19:42.610 --> 19:46.390
♪ Aku bertanggung jawab ♪

19:42.950 --> 19:44.910
[Pegadaian Taiyufeng]

19:46.480 --> 19:49.260
♪ Matahari terbit dari timur ♪

19:55.260 --> 19:55.960
